that natural, genuine curiosity is actually&nbsp;
a choice. It's not a gene, right. Curiosity-&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:24.480
you weren't just born with or without curiosity.&nbsp;
In fact, I would argue that we're all born with an&nbsp;&nbsp;

